# Settings
DeliverablesSetup = Deliverables setup
DeliverablesSetupIntro = Prototype settings. Sample mode shows mock data for UX review; turn it off once live resolution is wired. Debug enables the admin-only discovery endpoint.
DeliverablesSampleMode = Sample data mode
DeliverablesSampleModeHelp = When enabled, every surface shows a coherent mock dataset (tagged "Sample data") instead of live order/shipment data. Turn off once live resolution is in place.
DeliverablesDebugMode = Debug mode
DeliverablesDebugModeHelp = When enabled, admins can call the discovery endpoint (ajax/debug.php) used to map the order to shipment to lot linkage.
